# Root .dockerignore — applies to any image whose docker-compose build.context is the
# monorepo root (currently apps/customer_web/Dockerfile, since it depends on the local
# workspace package packages/shared_types and needs the whole workspace tree visible to
# `npm install`; see docs/troubleshooting.md). services/api still builds with its own
# service directory as context and keeps its own .dockerignore for that.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
coverage
**/coverage
.git
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
services/api/test
